# Merged into Mo AI. The Hardware Centre and the Compatibility Hub were separate windows onto
# the same device JSON that Mo AI already reads — and only Mo AI can explain a problem and
# offer the repair. Mo AI is the single door now: its "جهازي | My device" view shows the
# problems and their fixes, and opens this detailed report from there (moos://app/hardware,
# moos://app/compat). The app is NOT removed — only taken out of the menu.
NoDisplay=true
